	(text "03 - IMU\nBosch BNO055 9-axis with on-chip fusion, I2C mode (PS1 = PS0 = GND), address 0x28 (COM3 low).\nBus pull-ups live on the Vision board. nBOOT_LOAD_PIN and nRESET pulled up (10k), CAP 1u, 100n on\neach supply, optional 32.768 kHz crystal with 22p loads (CLK_SEL selects it; internal clock is the\ndefault). INT, BL_IND, SWD and the do-not-connect pins left open. Bosch DS000 rev 1.8 figure 9." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b1a00004-0000-4000-8000-000000000082"))
